The dependencies do not need to be installed in the system folder. The can be set in the backend.parameters as follows

bp =

  list(

    hadoop =

      list(D = paste("R_LIBS=","/opt/apps/intel15/mvapich2_2_1/big-data-r/3.1.3/r-library:/opt/apps/intel15/mvapich2_2_1/Rstats/3.1.3/lib64/R/library",sep='')

          )

)

rmr.options(backend.parameters = bp);

